$info=1943,1943j,1943ja,1943u,1943ua
$cmd
1943: The Battle of Midway                                  © 1987 Capcom
1943: Midway Kaisen
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@F-button : Fire
^s : Special
_S : Start

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Loop                                                                     @F-button _+ ^s

- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Start the Stage with a Weapon
   - On the beginning of the Stage, hold the direction and buttons on both sides:
     - Stage 01 with Small Shot Gun          1P side _2                        2P side @F-button
     - Stage 02 with Big Shot Gun            1P side @F-button                 2P side ^s
     - Stage 03 with Laser                   1P side _9 _+ @F-button _+ ^s     2P side _2 _+ ^s
     - Stage 04 with Big Shot Gun            1P side _1 _+ ^s                  2P side _7
     - Stage 05 with 3-way                   1P side @F-button                 2P side _8
     - Stage 06 with Auto                    1P side _4                        2P side _6 _+ ^s
     - Stage 07 with Shell                   1P side _7                        2P side _2
     - Stage 08 with 3-way                   1P side _4 _+ @F-button _+ ^s     2P side @F-button _+ ^s
     - Stage 09 with Laser                   1P side _3 _+ @F-button _+ ^s     2P side _3 _+ @F-button _+ ^s
     - Stage 10 with Shell                   1P side _9 _+ ^s                  2P side _3
     - Stage 11 with Auto                    1P side _7                        2P side _6 _+ @F-button
     - Stage 12 with 3-way                   1P side _6 _+ @F-button _+ ^s     2P side _9 _+ @F-button _+ ^s
     - Stage 13 with Auto                    1P side _8                        2P side _2
     - Stage 14 with Laser                   1P side _7 _+ @F-button _+ ^s     2P side _6 _+ @F-button _+ ^s
     - Stage 15 with Shell                   1P side _3 _+ @F-button           2P side _1 _+ @F-button
     - Stage 16 with Auto                    1P side _6 _+ @F-button           2P side _9 _+ @F-button
$end

