$info=1943kai,1943mii
$cmd
1943 Kai: Midway Kaisen                                     © 1988 Capcom
1943: The Battle of Midway Mark II                          © 1987 Capcom
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@F-button : Fire
^s : Special
_S : Start

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Loop                                                                     @F-button _+ ^s

- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Start the Stage with a Weapon
   - On the beginning of the Stage, hold the direction and buttons on both sides:
     - Stage 01 with Shot Gun                1P side _6                        2P side _9
     - Stage 02 with Laser                   1P side _7                        2P side _2 _+ ^s
     - Stage 03 with 3-way                   1P side @F-button                 2P side _7
     - Stage 04 with 3-way                   1P side _1 _+ @F-button           2P side _8 _+ @F-button
     - Stage 05 with Shell                   1P side _4                        2P side _3 _+ @F-button
     - Stage 06 with Laser                   1P side _1 _+ ^s                  2P side _7 _+ @F-button
     - Stage 07 with 3-way                   1P side _2 _+ @F-button _+ ^s     2P side ^s
     - Stage 08 with Laser                   1P side _1 _+ ^s                  2P side _2 _+ @F-button
     - Stage 09 with Shell                   1P side _7 _+ ^s                  2P side _3 _+ @F-button _+ ^s
     - Stage 10 with 3-way                   1P side _8 _+ @F-button           2P side _7
$end

