$info=19xx,19xxa,19xxar1,19xxb,19xxh,19xxj,19xxjr1,19xxjr2,19xxu
$cmd
19XX: The War Against Destiny                               © 1996 Capcom
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@F-button : Fire
_B : Bomb
_S : Start

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Homing Attack                                                            _O@F-button
Charged Bomb                                                             _O_B

- PLANES -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Lightning
Speed              6
Power              4
Homing             7
Weapon           Shells

Mosquito
Speed              4
Power              10
Homing             3
Weapon          Missiles

Sinden
Speed              9
Power              3
Homing             5
Weapon           Laser

- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Play BGM from "1942" on the first Stage
   - After insert coins press _8_6_6_6_6_6_6_6_6_6_2_2_2_2_4_4

_` Play a Arranged BGM from "1942" on the first Stage
   - After insert coins press _8_2_2_2_2_2_2_2_2_2_7_3_9_1_7_3_9_1
$end

