$info=sonicwi3
$cmd
Aero Fighters 3                                       © 1995 Video System
Sonic Wings 3
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Fire
_B : Bomb
_C : Not Used
_D : Not Used
_S : Start
^S : Select (AES only)

- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Aka Usagi "Red Rabbit"
   - On the Plane Select Screen, put the cursor on Keaton _O_S_+_B and press _2 every time that "rotating plane" is facing directly towards you

_` Diabloon
   - On the Plane Select Screen, put the cursor on Blazers _O_S_+_B and press _2 every time that "rotating plane" is facing directly towards you
$end

