$info=aerofgts,aerofgtst,sncwgltd
$cmd
Aero Fighters Special                                 © 1996 Video System
Sonic Wings Limited
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@F-button : Fire
_B : Bomb
_S : Start

- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Stage Select
   _` Stage 5: Aegean Sea
      - Complete Stage 4 with less than 500.000 points
   _` Stage 5: New York
      - Complete Stage 4 with more than 500.000 points
   _` Stage 6: Red Square
      - Complete Stage 5 with less than 550.000 points
   _` Stage 6: Panama Canal
      - Complete Stage 5 with more than 550.000 points
   _` Stage 7: Fight in Orbit
      - Complete Stage 6 with less than 600.000 points
   _` Stage 7: Another Dimension
      - Complete Stage 6: Red Square with more than 600.000 points
   _` Stage 7: Mars
      - Complete Stage 6: Panama Canal with more than 600.000 points and without losing a Life
$end

