   - On the Stage Title Screen _O_B_+_C and press:
     - Missile                 _9
     - Flame-thrower           _1
     - Laser                   _3
     - Bomb                    _7

_` Start the Stage with Enhancement Module
   - On a 2P/3P game, during the cutscene, the player that pick up the Radio item must hold:
     - Alpha Fortress          _2
     - Beta Cannon             _8
     - Gamma Battler           _4 / _6
$end

