_& Super Death Blows / Ultimate KO

_` Special Moves
   - Needs a amount of Spirit Gauge (%)

_` Super Death Blows / Ultimate KO
   - Super Death Blows needs a amount of Spirit Gauge (%) and a FLASHING Life Bar
   - Ultimate KO needs a amount of Spirit Gauge (%), a FLASHING Life Bar and opponent's Life Bar is below to 10%

_` Rush Combos
   - h = High Level Attack
   - m = Mid Level Attack
   - l = Low Level Attack
   - H = High Level Attack with Juggle Starter
   - M = Mid Level Attack with Juggle Starter

_` Flashing Life Bar
