$info=batcir,batcira,batcirj
$cmd
Battle Circuit                                              © 1997 Capcom
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Attack
_B : Jump
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_# Special Ability
_* Desperation Moves
_& Super Desperation Move

_` Special Ability
   - Needs a B. D. L. unit

_` Desperation Moves
   - Needs a small amount of Life Bar

_` Super Desperation Move
   - Needs a partner
   - Needs a small amount of Life Bar for both character
   - Stand close for the partner and both must press _A_+_B together

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) Run                                                                   _? _? (same direction)
