$info=bigfight,bigfightj
$cmd
Big Fight: Big Trouble in the Atlantic Ocean               © 1992 Tatsumi
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Attack
@J-button : Jump
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_* Desperation Moves
_& Anger Awakening

