- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` CPU Battles
   - Needs to be unlocked with Password first
   _` Fight Morrigan on Stage 4
      - Use the Capcom Groove
      - Win 5 rounds with Super Combos
      - Get 60.000 Groove Points
   _` Fight Nakoruru on Stage 4
      - Use the SNK Groove
      - Win 5 rounds with Super Combos
      - Get 60.000 Groove Points
   _` Fight Akuma after the Final Stage
      - Win 10 rounds with Super Combos
      - Get 80.000 Groove Points

_` Pair Play Mode
   - After insert coins _O^W and press _S
