- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^E : Weak Punch (_P)
^F : Medium Punch (_P)
^G : Strong Punch (_P)
^H : Weak Kick (_K)
^I : Medium Kick (_K)
^J : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Super Combos

- GROOVE SYSTEM -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` C-GROOVE
   - Super Bar Max Level 3
   - Guard Gauge standard
   - can use Air Blocking
   - can Super Cancel a Level 2 Super Combo in any Special Move / Level 1 Super Combo
   - with a Super Bar on Level 1 damage increased by 1%
   - with a Super Bar on Level 2 damage increased by 2%
   - with a Super Bar on Level 3 damage increased by 5%
   - Level 1 Super Combos must be done with ^E / ^H and needs 1LV of Super Bar
   - Level 2 Super Combos must be done with ^F / ^I and needs 2LVs of Super Bar
   - Level 3 Super Combos must be done with ^G / ^J and needs 3LVs of Super Bar

_` A-GROOVE
   - Super Bar Max Level 2
   - Guard Gauge standard
   - Level 1 Super Combos needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` P-GROOVE
   - Super Bar Max Level 1
   - Guard Gauge is 20% smaller
   - Level 3 Super Combos needs a FULL Super Bar

_` S-GROOVE
   - Super Bar Max Level 1
   - Guard Gauge standard
   - with a Super Bar in MAX damage increased by 15%
   - with a flashing Life Bar damage increased by 5%
   - Level 1 Super Combos needs a Super Bar in MAX / FLASHING Life Bar
   - Level 3 Super Combos needs a Super Bar in MAX and a FLASHING Life Bar

_` N-GROOVE
   - Super Bar Max Level 3
   - Guard Gauge standard
   - with TIME Gauge Activated damage increased by 20%
   - Level 1 Super Combos needs 1 Stock of Super Bar
   - Level 3 Super Combos needs 1 Stock of Super Bar and TIME Gauge Activated

_` K-GROOVE
   - Super Bar Max Level 1
   - Guard Gauge is 10% smaller
   - with a FULL Super Bar damage increased by 35% for Normal Attacks and 30% for Special Moves
   - Level 3 Super Combos needs a FULL Super Bar

- RATIO SYSTEM -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Ratio System Damage
   - Ratio-1 Character have damage reduced by 20% compared to Ratio-2 Character
   - Ratio-2 Character have Standard Damage
   - Ratio-3 Character have damage increased by 15% compared to Ratio-2 Character
   - Ratio-4 Character have damage increased by 30% compared to Ratio-2 Character

