- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^E : Weak Punch (_P)
^F : Medium Punch (_P)
^G : Strong Punch (_P)
^H : Weak Kick (_K)
^I : Medium Kick (_K)
^J : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* EX Moves

_` ES Moves
   - Moves with (ES) have a ES Version
   - Needs a FULL Special Bar

_` Guard Cancel Moves
   - Moves with (G) can be used when blocking
   - Needs a Full Special Bar

_` EX Moves
   - Needs a FULL Special Bar

