- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` 2nd and 3rd Outfit
   - On the Character Select Screen, press _2 / _8

_` VTR Replay
   - Before the replay start, press _H_+_K
   - Use _P to rewind

_` Burst Mode
   - On the Test Mode, go to GAME MODE SETTINGS and turns BURST MODE to ON
   - After insert coins _O_H_+_P_+_K and press _S
$end

