Dead or Alive ++                                             © 1998 Tecmo
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_H : Hold
_P : Punch
_K : Kick
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Throws & Holds
_) Command Moves

_` String Moves
   - h = High Level Attack
   - m = Mid Level Attack
   - l = Low Level Attack
   - g = Hits Knocked Down Opponent
   - - = No Hit

_` Positions
   - BK = Back Turned

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) Dash                                                                  _6_6
_) Run                                                                   _6^6
_) Retreat                                                               _4_4
_) Low Dash                                                              _3_3
_) Low Retreat                                                           _1_1
_) Reverse High/Mid Attack                                               _H
_) Reverse Low Attack                                                    _2 / _1_+_H
_) Throw Escape                                                          when thrown _H_+_P
_) Multipart Throw Escape                                                when thrown _H_+_P_+_K
_) Safe Landing                                                          being knocked down _H_+_P_+_K
_) Roll to Background and Get Up                                         knocked down _H
_) Roll to Foreground and Get Up                                         knocked down ^2_+_H
_) Roll Backwards and Get Up                                             knocked down ^4
_) Get Up and Mid Kick                                                   knocked down _K
_) Get Up and Low Kick                                                   knocked down ^2_+_K
_) Taunt                                                                 _6_4_6 / _4_6_4_+_H_+_P_+_K

