- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_H : Hold
_P : Punch
_K : Kick
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Throws, Holds and Tag Throws
_) Command Moves

_` String Moves
   - h = High Level Attack
   - m = Mid Level Attack
   - l = Low Level Attack
   - g = Hits Knocked Down Opponent
   - - = No Hit

_` Positions
   - BK = Back Turned

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) Dash                                                                  _6_6
_) Run                                                                   _6^6
_) Retreat                                                               _4_4
_) Low Dash                                                              _3_3
_) Low Retreat                                                           _1_1
_) Tag                                                                   _H_+_P_+_K
_) Sidestep In                                                           _8_+_H
_) Sidestep Out                                                          _2_2_+_H
_) Moving                                                                _O_H, _4_4 / _6_6 / _2_2 / _8_8
_) Throw Escape                                                          when thrown _H_+_P
_) Safe Landing                                                          being knocked down _H / _P / _K
_) Get Up                                                                _H
_) Roll to Background and Get Up                                         knocked down ^8_+_H
_) Roll to Foreground and Get Up                                         knocked down ^2_+_H

