- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Kasumi 4th Outfit and Ayane 3rd Outfit
   - After insert coins press _O_P_+_K and press _S

_` VTR Replay
   - Before the replay start, press _H_+_K
   - Use _P to rewind

_` Unlocks Tag Battle Mode (Dead or Alive 2 only)
   - On the Game Test Mode, go to PASSWORD, select TAG BATTLE MODE and enter a password below:
     LOVE? = Unlocks Tag Battle Mode

_` Unlocks Survival Mode (Dead or Alive 2 only)
   - On the Game Test Mode, go to PASSWORD, select SURVIVAL MODE and enter a password below:
     MIRAI = Unlocks Survival Mode
$end

###################################################################################################

$info=denjinmk,denjinmka
$cmd
Denjin Makai                                             © 1994 Banpresto
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Attack
@J-button : Jump
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves
_# Tag Special Moves
_& Tag Super Moves

_` Special Moves
   - Needs 33% of Power Meter

_` Desperation Moves
   - Needs a FULL Power Meter and a RED Life Bar

_` Tag Special Moves
   - Needs 33% of Power Meter for both Characters

_` Tag Super Moves
   - Needs 66% of Power Meter for both Characters

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) Run                                                                   _6^6
_) Block                                                                 _O_A
_) Pick Up Object                                                        close to object _A
_) Pick Up Weapon                                                        close to weapon _A
_) Teammate Toss                                                         grab a partner _A

- MAKAI -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Grab                                                                  close _6
_(   ^!Driving Knees                                                     _A_A_A
_(   ^!Overhead Toss                                                     _4 / _6_+_A
_(   ^!Flip Over German Suplex                                           @J-button

_) Jabs-Kicks                                                            _A_A_A_A
_) Turnaround Backfist                                                   _4_+_A
_) Elbow Drop                                                            _^_2_+_A
_) Digging Fist                                                          running _A
_) Dropping Heal                                                         running @J-button _A

_@ Burning Sobat                                                         _O_A_4_6
_@ Jet Upper                                                             _O_A_2_8
_@ Tornado Burster                                                       _A_+@J-button
_@ Sonic Blaster                                                         running _A_+@J-button

_* Thunder Cyclone                                                       _O_A_8_2_6

_# Cross Hurricane                                                       grab opponent, Black Knight press _A from behind
_# Somersault Spin                                                       grab opponent, Iyo press _A from behind
_# T. Piledriver                                                         grab opponent, Belva press _A from behind
_# Needle Press                                                          grab opponent, Zeldia press _A from behind
_# T. Body Press                                                         grab opponent, Tulks press _A from behind

_& Twin Sonic Cannon                                                     grab Black Knight _A_+@J-button
_& Twin Bullet                                                           grab Iyo _A_+@J-button
_& Plasma Field                                                          grab Belva _A_+@J-button
_& Needle Burster                                                        grab Zeldia _A_+@J-button
_& Tempest Crash                                                         grab Tulks _A_+@J-button

- BLACK KNIGHT (KUROKISHI) -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Grab                                                                  close _6
_(   ^!Crunch Knees                                                      _A_A_A
_(   ^!Overhead Toss                                                     _4 / _6_+_A
_(   ^!Flip Over Overhead Toss                                           @J-button

_) Side Kicks                                                            _A_A_A_A_A
_) Turnaround High Kick                                                  _4_+_A
_) Foot Stomp                                                            _^_2_+_A
_) Turn Kick                                                             running _A
_) Double Jump Kick                                                      running @J-button _A
_) Wall Jump Kick                                                        jump against the wall _6_+_A

_@ Lightning Attack                                                      _O_A_4_6
_@ Spiral Upper Cut                                                      _O_A_2_8
_@ Spinning Kick                                                         _A_+@J-button
