- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Outfit Select
   - 1st Outfit, select the character with _A / _B / _C / _D
   - 2nd Outfit, select the character with _S

_` Character Name Bonus
   - Value of the character:
     0 = A / F / K
     1 = B / G / L
     2 = C / H / M
     3 = D / I / N
     4 = E / J / O
     5 = 0 / 5
     6 = 1 / 6
     7 = 2 / 7 / ? / ! / (Greek Symbol) / - / I / II / III / (Space)
     8 = 3 / 8
     9 = 4 / 9
   - The sum of all characters until reach a single digit will give a type below and give an item:
     0 = Type A = Medal
     1 = Type B = Boots of Speed
     2 = Type C = Head Equipment: Battle Helmet (Fighter, Dwarf) / Cleric's Hat (Cleric) / Circlet (Elf) / Magical Hat (Magic User) / Hood (Thief)
     3 = Type D = Ring of Protection
     4 = Type E = Ring of Fire Resistance
     5 = Type F = Ring of Spell Turning
     6 = Type G = Gauntlets of Ogre Power
     7 = Type H = Accessories: Anklet (Fighter, Dwarf) / Brooch (Cleric, Thief) / Earring (Elf) / Rod of Fire (Magic User)
     8 = Type I = Accessories: Bracelet (Fighter, Cleric, Elf, Thief, Dwarf) / Rod of Cold (Magic User)
     9 = Type J = Accessories: Orb (Fighter, Cleric, Thief, Dwarf) / Necklace (Elf) / Rod of Lightning (Magic User)
$end

