Fatal Fury 3: Road to the Final Victory                        © 1995 SNK
Garou Densetsu 3: Haruka-naru Tatakai
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Start
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves
_& Hidden Desperation Moves

_` Plane System
   - Moves with (M) pulls the opponent to Main Plane
   - Moves with (B) pushes the opponent to Back Plane
   - Moves with (F) pushes the opponent to Front Plane

_` Desperation Moves
   - Needs a FLASHING Life Bar

_` Hidden Desperation Moves
   - Needs a FLASHING Life Bar
   - Can only be done once per round
   - Must be activated first
   - MVS Version: Before the match begins, on the word "GO!", press _S_+_A_+_B_+_C_+_D
   - AES Version: Before the match begins, on the word "GO!", press _S_+_A_+_C_+_D
   - Character name changes to green

