   - Needs a FLASHING Life Bar

_` Overdrive Power
   - Needs a Heat Gauge in MAX

_` Combos
   - c = this hit can be canceled in any Special Moves / Super Power Attacks / Overdrive Power
   - j = this hit can juggle
   - # = this hit can't be canceled

