Fighting Vipers                                               © 1995 Sega
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_P : Punch
_K : Kick
_G : Guard
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Throws
_) Command Moves

_` String Moves
   - h   = High Level Attack
   - m   = Mid Level Attack
   - l   = Low Level Attack
   - g   = Hits Knocked Down Opponent
   - B   = Break Armour Attack
   - -   = No Hit

_` Positions
   - BK    = Back Turned

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) Dash                                                                  _6_6
_) Run                                                                   _6^6
_) Retreat                                                               _4_4
_) Crawl Forward                                                         ^3
_) Crawl Backward                                                        ^1
_) Normal Jump                                                           _8
_) Low Jump                                                              _X_8
_) Backflip                                                              _7
_) Sankaku Tobi                                                          jump against the wall
_) Flipout                                                               knocked down on air _P_+_K_+_G
_) Get Up                                                                knocked down ^*_P
_) Roll to Background and Get Up                                         knocked down _8
_) Roll to Foreground and Get Up                                         knocked down _2
_) Roll Backwards and Get Up                                             knocked down _4
_) Roll Forward and Get Up                                               knocked down _6
_) Armour Blast                                                          _6_4_6_4_+_P_+_K_+_G

