Garou: Mark of the Wolves                                      © 1999 SNK
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Super Powers (S.POWER)
_& Potential Powers (P.POWER)
_# T.O.P. Attack

_` Break Moves
   - Moves with (B) can be canceled with _A_+_B

_` Super Powers
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` Potential Powers
   - Needs 2LVs of Super Bar

_` T.O.P. Attack
   - Needs the a FLASHING T.O.P. Area on Life Bar

_` T.O.P. Damage Chart
   - Standard T.O.P. Area have damage increased by 25%
   - ⅔ of T.O.P. Area have damage increased by 50% (AES only) (2P Game only)
   - ⅓ of T.O.P. Area have damage increased by 75% (AES only) (2P Game only)

_` Combos
   - c = this hit can be canceled in any Special Moves / S.POWER / P.POWER
   - # = this hit can't be canceled

