- jump vertical _D# _! _A#

- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Fight Kain on Stage 8 (Good Ending)
   - Complete the game with an average Fighting Level AAA

_` Survival Mode
   - After insert coins _O_A_+_B_+_C_+_D and press _S

_` Roulette
   - On the Character Select Screen _O_S

_` Increase T.O.P. Attack Damage (AES only)
   - On the T.O.P. Area Select Screen, press _2 / _8
   - Only on a 2P Game
$end

