_` Color Select
   - 1st Color, select the character with _P
   - 2nd Color, select the character with _K
   - 3rd Color, select the character with _a
   - 4th Color, select the character with _b
   - 5th Color, select the character with _D
   - 6th Color, select the character with _S

_` M.O.M. Mode (Medal of Millionaire)
   - After insert coins _O_P_+_K_+_a_+_b_+_D and press _S
   - In M.A.M.E., in addition to the 5 buttons above, you must hold a 6th button on your configuration to work
