- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_P : Punch
_K : Kick
_a : Slash
_b : Hard Slash
_D : Dust Attack
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_# Force Breaks
_* Overdrive Attack
_& Instant Kill

_` Force Break
   - Needs 25% of Tension Gauge

_` Overdrive Attack
   - Needs 50% of Tension Gauge

_` Instant Kill
   - Must be in Instant Kill Mode (not for Dizzy)

