$info=jojo,jojoa,jojoar1,jojoar2,jojoj,jojojr1,jojojr2,jojon,jojonr1,jojonr2,jojor1,jojor2,jojou,jojour1,jojour2
$cmd
JoJo's Venture                                              © 1998 Capcom
JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_a : Light Attack
_b : Medium Attack
_c : Heavy Attack
^s : Stand
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Super Combos

_` Stand System
   - Moves with (N) can only be done with the Stand Off
   - Moves with (S) can only be done with Stand On

_` Super Combos
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) (N/S) Dash                                                            _6_6
_) (N/S) Retreat                                                         _4_4
_) (N/S) Normal Jump                                                     _8
_) (N/S) Low Jump                                                        _X_8
_) (N/S) Long Jump                                                       running _9
_) (─/S) 2 Dan Jump                                                      _^_8
_) (N/─) Dodge                                                           _a_+_b_+_c
_) (N/S) Mid-Air Recovery                                                knocked down on air _a_+_b / _a_+_c / _b_+_c
_) (N/S) Ground Recovery                                                 knocked down _a_+_b / _a_+_c / _b_+_c
_) (N/S) Advancing Guard                                                 blocking _a_+_b_+_c
_) (N/S) Guard Cancel                                                    blocking _2_3_6_+_a / _b / _c
