- SECRET CHARACTERS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Young Joseph
   - On the Character Select Screen, press _S on Jotaro, Polnareff, Joseph, Kakyoin, Iggi, Avdol and Joseph
   - Wait a moment, then _O_S

_` Dio
   - On the Character Select Screen, press _S on Alessy, D'Bo and Chaca
   - Put the cursor on Midler and press _S_S_S

_` Shadow Dio
   - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Dio and press _S_S_S_S_S_S_S_S_S_S, then _O_S

_` Unlocks all Characters with Operator's Code
   - On the Test Menu, go to CONFIGURATION, then GAME and press _8_2_6_4_a_b_c^s

