- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^E : Weak Punch (_P)
^F : Medium Punch (_P)
^G : Strong Punch (_P)
^H : Weak Kick (_K)
^I : Medium Kick (_K)
^J : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_@ Special Moves
_* Shadow Moves
_# Transition Moves
_) Other Moves

_` Shadow Moves
   - Needs a FLASHING LINE on Life Bar

_` Other Moves
   _` Retaliation
      - Use when knocked down
   _` Combo Breaker
      - Use to break a combo

_` Finishing Moves
   _` No Mercy
      - After winning the match
   _` Humiliation
      - After winning the match without losing a round
      - Can be done anywhere
   _` Ultimate
      - Win a round
      - When your opponent Life Bar is FLASHING
      - Start any combo and finish with the Ultimate
   _` Ultra Combo
      - Win a round
      - When your opponent Life Bar is FLASHING
      - Start any combo and finish with the Ultra Combo

