Killer Instinct 2                                           © 1996 Midway
Rebuilt by: Fabricio Coroquer (Created by: Procyon)

- CONTROLS -
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
^E : Weak Punch (_P)
^F : Medium Punch (_P)
^G : Strong Punch (_P)
^H : Weak Kick (_K)
^I : Medium Kick (_K)
^J : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_@ Special Moves
_# Transition Moves
_) Other Moves
_* Super Moves

_` Other Moves
   _` Retaliation
      - Use when knocked down
   _` Spirit Move
      - After lose the match, will come back with ⅛ of Life Bar and 6 Bars of Super Gauge
      - Needs ⅛ of Life Bar
   _` Combo Breaker
      - Use to break a combo
   _` Ultra Breaker
      - Use to break a Ultra Combo
      - Must be hit by the 5th hit of Ultra Combo
      - Needs 6 Bars of Super Gauge
   _` Counter Attack
      - Use ^4_+_O^E to block a normal attack, than use this move
   _` Counter Dizzy
      - Use ^4_+_O^E to block a normal attack, than use this move

_` Super Moves
   - Needs a amount of Bars of Super Gauge

_` Finishing Moves
   _` No Mercy
      - After wwinning the match
      - Can be done anywhere
   _` Assault
      - When your opponent Life Bar is FLASHING
      - Start any combo and finish with the Assault
   _` Ultimate
      - Win a round
      - When your opponent Life Bar is FLASHING
      - Start any combo and finish with the Ultimate
   _` Ultra Combo
      - Win a round
      - When your opponent Life Bar is FLASHING
      - Start any combo and finish with the Ultra Combo

