- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves / Super Desperation Moves

_` ADVANCED MODE
   - Super Bar Max Level 3
   - Desperation Moves needs 1 Stock of Super Bar
   - Super Desperation Moves needs 1 Stock of Super Bar and TIME Gauge Activated

_` EXTRA MODE
   - Super Bar Max Level 1
   - Desperation Moves needs a Super Bar in MAX / FLASHING Life Bar
   - Super Desperation Moves needs a Super Bar in MAX and a FLASHING Life Bar

- COMMON COMMANDS -
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
ADVANCED MODE
_) Run                                                                   _6^6
_) Retreat                                                               _4_4
_) Normal Jump                                                           _8
_) Low Jump                                                              _X_8
_) High Jump                                                             _2_8
_) Long Jump                                                             running _9
_) Roll Forward                                                          _A_+_B
_) Roll Backward                                                         _4_+_A_+_B
_) Body Blow                                                             (_^)_C_+_D
_) Activate Time Gauge (1 Stock)                                         _A_+_B_+_C
_) Safe Fall                                                             being knocked down _A_+_B
_) Team Assistance                                                       dizzed _A_+_B_+_C
_) Guard Cancel in Roll Forward (1 Stock)                                blocking _A_+_B
_) Guard Cancel in Roll Backward (1 Stock)                               blocking _4_+_A_+_B
_) Guard Cancel in Body Blow (1 Stock)                                   blocking _C_+_D

EXTRA MODE
_) Dash                                                                  _6_6
_) Retreat                                                               _4_4
_) Normal Jump                                                           _8
_) High Jump                                                             _2_8
_) Sidestep                                                              _A_+_B
_) Body Blow                                                             (_^)_C_+_D
_) Charge POW Gauge                                                      _O_A_+_B_+_C
_) Safe Fall                                                             being knocked down _A_+_B
_) Team Assistance                                                       dizzed _A_+_B_+_C
_) Guard Cancel in Roll Forward (MAX)                                    blocking _A_+_B
_) Guard Cancel in Roll Backward (MAX)                                   blocking _4_+_A_+_B
_) Guard Cancel in Body Blow (MAX)                                       blocking _C_+_D

