_` Awakened Orochi Team
   - On the Character Select Screen _O_S and press _8_4_2_6_8_2_+_B_+_C
   - Must unlock Orochi Iori or Orochi Leona first

_` Orochi
   - Playable only with M.A.M.E. Cheats

