- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves / Super Desperation Moves

_` ADVANCED MODE
   - Super Bar Max Level 3 for 1st character
   - Super Bar Max Level 4 for 2nd character
   - Super Bar Max Level 5 for 3rd character
   - Desperation Moves needs 1 Stock of Super Bar
   - Super Desperation Moves needs 1 Stock of Super Bar and MAX Mode Activated
   - Super Desperation Moves needs 3 Stocks with done with _A_+_C / _B_+_D

_` EXTRA MODE
   - Super Bar Max Level 1
   - Desperation Moves needs a Super Bar in MAX / MAX Mode Activated / FLASHING Life Bar
   - Super Desperation Moves needs MAX Mode Activated and a FLASHING Life Bar

_` ULTIMATE MODE
   - Super Bar Max Level depends of Style Gauge was chosen
   - Desperation Moves depends of Style Gauge was chosen
   - Super Desperation Moves depends of Style Gauge was chosen

