$cmd
The King of Fighters '99: Millennium Battle                    © 1999 SNK
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves (DM) / Super Desperation Moves (SDM)
_# Striker Moves

_` Desperation Moves (DM) / Super Desperation Moves (SDM)
   - Desperation Moves needs 1 Stock of Super Bar
   - Super Desperation Moves needs 1 Stock of Super Bar and a FLASHING Life Bar

_` Striker Moves
   - The character must be in Striker Position
   - Needs 1 Striker Stock

_` COUNTER MODE
   - 20 seconds of duration
   - Damage increased
   - Can use DMs and Guard Cancels without a Stock
   - Can't use SDMs
   - Can cancel a Side Attack on Special Move / DM
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in DMs
   - Remains 10 seconds without a Power Gauge after the end of the mode

_` ARMOR MODE
   - 8 seconds of duration
   - Damage increased
   - Defense increased
   - Don't takes block damage
   - Super Armor
   - Can use Guard Cancels without a Stock
   - Can't use DMs / SDMs
   - Side Attack will knock down the opponent
   - Remains 10 seconds without a Power Gauge after the end of the mode

