_` Unlocks "K.I." on Title Screen (MVS only)
   - Win a battle with a team of 4 random characters consisting of 3 of them are from the list below:
     - For "K": K, Maxima, Benimaru, Shingo, Whip, Kyo-1 and Kyo-2
     - For "I": Leona, Athena, Bao, Xiangfei, Kasumi, Kim and Jhun

_` Kyo Kusanagi
   - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Roulette Box _O_S and press _4_6_8_4_2_6
   - Must have a "K" on Title Screen first

_` Iori Yagami
   - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Roulette Box _O_S and press _6_4_8_6_2_4
   - Must have a "I" on Title Screen first

