$info=kof2000,kof2000n
$cmd
The King of Fighters 2000                                      © 2000 SNK
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves (DM)
_& Super Desperation Moves (SDM)
_# Striker Moves

_` Desperation Moves (DM)
   - Needs 1 Stock of Super Bar

_` Super Desperation Moves (SDM)
   - Needs 3 Stocks of Super Bar

_` Striker Moves
   - The character must be in Striker Position
   - Needs 1 Striker Stock
     - 1st character is the Normal Striker
     - 2st character is the Another Striker
     - 3rd character is the Maniac Striker (put the cursor on Another Striker and press _8_4_4_4_6_6_6_2)

_` COUNTER MODE
   - 20 seconds of duration
   - Damage increased
   - Can use DMs and Guard Cancels without a Stock
   - Can't use SDMs
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in DMs

_` ARMOR MODE
   - 15 seconds of duration
   - Damage increased
   - Defense increased
   - Don't takes block damage
   - Super Armor
   - Can use Guard Cancels without a Stock
   - Can't use DMs / SDMs

