$info=kof2001,kof2001h
$cmd
The King of Fighters 2001                                   © 2001 Eolith
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves (DM)
_& Super Desperation Moves (SDM)
_# Striker Moves

_` Desperation Moves (DM)
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` Super Desperation Moves (SDM)
   - Needs 2LVs of Super Bar

_` Striker Moves
   - The character must be in Striker Position
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` Super Cancel
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in DMs / SDMs
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` Wire Whip System
   - Moves with (W) are Critical Wire, the opponent will bounce off the wall if hit
   - Moves with (C) are Counter Wire, the opponent will bounce off the wall if hit on Counter

- STRIKER SYSTEM / RATIO SYSTEM -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` 4 Characters on line up and 0 Strikers
   - Super Bar Max Level 1
   - Long Super Bar to fill
   - Damage increased by 35%
   - Defense decreased by 50%
   - Life Recovery decreased by 50%
_` 3 Characters on line up and 1 Strikers
   - Super Bar Max Level 2
   - Standard Super Bar to fill
   - Damage standard
   - Defense standard
   - Life Recovery standard
_` 2 Characters on line up and 2 Strikers
   - Super Bar Max Level 3
   - Medium Super Bar to fill
   - Damage standard
   - Defense increased by 50%
   - Life Recovery increased by 300%
_` 1 Characters on line up and 3 Strikers
   - Super Bar Max Level 4
   - Short Super Bar to fill
   - Damage decreased by 65%
   - Defense increased by 75%
   - Life Recovery increased by 300%

