$info=kof2002
$cmd
The King of Fighters 2002                                 © 2002 Playmore
Created: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves (DM)
_& Super Desperation Move (SDM)
_> Hidden Super Desperation Move (HSDM)

_` Desperation Moves (DM)
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar / MAX Mode Activated

_` Super Desperation Move (SDM)
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar and MAX Mode Activated

_` Hidden Super Desperation Move (HSDM)
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar, MAX Mode Activated and LOW Life Bar

_` Super Cancel
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in DMs / SDMs
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` Wire Whip System
   - Moves with (C) are Counter Wire, the opponent will bounce off the wall if hit on Counter

_` Super Bar Max Level
   - Level 3 for 1st character
   - Level 4 for 2nd character
   - Level 5 for 3rd character

_` MAX MODE
   - Damage decreased (not for DMs)
   - Can cancel a normal attack in any Special Moves that have a (I)
   - Can cancel a Command Move / Special Move with (O) in any Special Move with (I)

