- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Boss Battle
   _` Fight Adelheid Bernstein on Stage 7 (Bad Ending)
      - Defeat Kusanagi on Stage 4 with a Normal Attack / Throw / Command Move / Special Move
   _` Fight Chizuru Kagura & Maki Kagura on Stage 7 and Mukai on Stage 8 (Good Ending)
      - Defeat Kusanagi on Stage 4 with a DM / LDM / 1st hit of the Change Attack
$end

