$info=kofxi
$cmd
The King of Fighters XI                               © 2005 SNK Playmore
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
@E-button : Body Blow
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves (DM)
_& Leader Desperation Moves (LDM)

_` Desperation Moves (DM)
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` Leader Desperation Moves (LDM)
   - The character must be the Leader of the Team
   - Needs 2LVs of Super Bar

_` Super Cancel
   - Special Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in DMs / LDMs
   - Needs 1 Skill Stock

_` Dream Cancel
   - Desperation Moves with (!) can be Dream Canceled in LDMs
   - Needs 1 Skill Stock

_` Wire Whip System
   - Moves with (W) are Critical Wire, the opponent will bounce off the wall if hit
   - Moves with (C) are Counter Wire, the opponent will bounce off the wall if hit on Counter

_` Super Bar Max Level
   - Level 3 with 3 characters
   - Level 4 with 2 characters
   - Level 5 with 1 character

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) (-/─) Run                                                             _6^6
_) (-/─) Retreat                                                         _4_4
_) (-/─) Normal Jump                                                     _8
_) (-/─) Low Jump                                                        _X_8
_) (-/─) High Jump                                                       _2_8
_) (-/─) Long Jump                                                       running _9
_) (-/─) Roll Forward                                                    _A_+_B
_) (-/─) Roll Backward                                                   _4_+_A_+_B
_) (-/─) Throw Escape                                                    when thrown _4 / _6_+_C / _D
_) (-/─) Safe Fall Backward                                              being knocked down _A_+_B
_) (-/─) Safe Fall Forward                                               being knocked down _6_+_A_+_B
_) (-/─) Guard Cancel in Roll Forward (1LV)                              blocking _6_+_A_+_B
_) (-/─) Guard Cancel in Roll Backward (1LV)                             blocking _4_+_A_+_B
_) (-/─) Guard Cancel in Body Blow (1LV)                                 blocking _C_+_D
_) (-/─) Quick Evade (1 Skill Stock)                                     normal attack / Body Blow _A_+_B
_) (-/─) Normal Change to 2nd Character                                  _A_+_C
_) (-/─) Normal Change to 3rd Character                                  _B_+_D
_) (-/─) Quick Shift to 2nd Character (1 Skill Stock)                    any attack _A_+_C
_) (-/─) Quick Shift to 3rd Character (1 Skill Stock)                    any attack _B_+_D
_) (-/─) Saving Shift to 2nd Character (2 Skill Stocks)                  being hit _A_+_C
_) (-/─) Saving Shift to 3rd Character (2 Skill Stocks)                  being hit _B_+_D

