- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Color Select
   - 1st Color, select the character with _A
   - 2nd Color, select the character with _B
   - 3rd Color, select the character with _C
   - 4th Color, select the character with _D
   - 5th Color, select the character by _O@E-button and press _A
   - 6th Color, select the character by _O@E-button and press _B
   - 7th Color, select the character by _O@E-button and press _C
   - 8th Color, select the character by _O@E-button and press _D
   - 9th Color, select the character by _O_S and press _A
   - 10th Color, select the character by _O_S and press _B
   - 11th Color, select the character by _O_S and press _C
   - 12th Color, select the character by _O_S and press _D

_` Team Roulette
   - On the Character Select Screen _O_S and press _4 / _6

_` Individual Roulette
   - On the Character Select Screen _O_S and press _2 / _8

_` Random Leader
   - On the Leader Select Screen _O_S and press _P / _K

_` Random Order
   - On the Order Select Screen _O_S and press _P / _K

_` Show Characters on Order Select
   - On the Order Select Screen _O@E-button while selecting the order

_` Bonus Battle
   _` Fight Adelheid Bernstein on Stage 4
      - Don't meet any requirements below
   _` Fight Gai Tendo on Stage 4
      - Defeat 1 opponent with a LDM
   _` Fight Silber or Jyazu on Stage 4
      - Don't lose any round
      - Defeat 6 opponents with DMs
   _` Fight Sho Hayate on Stage 4
      - Defeat 2 opponents with LDMs
$end

