$info=kofnw,kofnwj
$cmd
The King of Fighters NeoWave                          © 2004 SNK Playmore
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
@E-button : Heat Mode
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves (DM)
_& Super Desperation Move (SDM)
_> Hidden Super Desperation Move (HSDM)

_` Wire Whip System
   - Moves with (W) are Critical Wire, the opponent will bounce off the wall if hit
   - Moves with (C) are Counter Wire, the opponent will bounce off the wall if hit on Counter

- MODES -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` SUPER CANCEL MODE (SC)
   - Super Bar Max Level 3
   - Some Special Moves can be Free Canceled in others Special Moves, needs 1LV of Super Bar
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in DMs / SDMs, needs 1LV of Super Bar
   - Desperation Moves needs 1LV of Super Bar
   - Super Desperation Moves needs 2LVs of Super Bar

_` GUARD BREAK MODE (GB)
   - Super Bar Max Level 2
   - Desperation Moves needs 1 Stock of Super Bar
   - Super Desperation Moves needs 2 Stocks of Super Bar

_` MAX2 MODE (M2)
   - Super Bar Max Level 1
   - Damage increased (not for DMs/SDMs)
   - Desperation Moves needs a Super Bar in MAX
   - Super Desperation Moves needs a Super Bar in MAX and a RED Life Bar
   - Hidden Super Desperation Move needs a Super Bar in MAX and a RED Life Bar

