$info=lastblad,lastbladh,lastsold
$cmd
The Last Blade                                                 © 1997 SNK
Bakumatsu Roman: Gekka no Kenshi
The Last Soldier
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Slash
_B : Strong Slash
_C : Weak Kick
_D : Repel
_S : Taunt
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves (DM)
_& Super Desperation Moves (SDM) / Shuuen no mai (Combo Special)

- MODES -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` POWER MODE
   - Damage increased
   - Can cause block damage with normal attacks
   - Can juggle after Overhead Slash
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in DMs / SDMs
   - Desperation Moves a needs Super Bar in MAX / FLASHING Life Bar
   - Super Desperation Moves needs a Super Bar in MAX and a FLASHING Life Bar

_` SPEED MODE
   - Can use Chain-Combos
       - c = this hit can be canceled in any Special Moves / DMs / Shuuen no mai
       - # = this hit can't be canceled
   - Desperation Moves a needs Super Bar in MAX / FLASHING Life Bar
   - Shuuen no mai needs a Super Bar in MAX and a FLASHING Life Bar

