$info=lastbld2
$cmd
The Last Blade 2                                               © 1998 SNK
Bakumatsu Roman: Dai Ni Maku Gekka no Kenshi
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Slash
_B : Medium Slash
_C : Weak Kick
_D : Repel
_S : Taunt
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves (DM)
_& Super Desperation Moves (SDM) / Shuuen no mai (Combo Special)

- MODES -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` POWER MODE
   - Damage increased by 30% in relation of SPEED MODE
   - Can cause block damage with normal attacks
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in DMs / SDMs
   - Desperation Moves a needs Super Bar in MAX / FLASHING Life Bar
   - Super Desperation Moves needs a Super Bar in MAX and a FLASHING Life Bar

_` SPEED MODE
   - Damage decreased by 30% in relation of POWER MODE
   - Can use Chain-Combos
       - c = this hit can be canceled in any Special Moves / DMs / Shuuen no mai
       - j = this hit can juggle
       - # = this hit can't be canceled
   - Desperation Moves a needs Super Bar in MAX / FLASHING Life Bar
   - Shuuen no mai needs a Super Bar in MAX and a FLASHING Life Bar

_` EX MODE
   - On the Mode Select Screen, put the cursor on SPEED and press _C_C_C_C_C_C, POWER and _B_B_B, SPEED and _C_C_C_C
   - Must be done in less than 4 seconds
   - Damage decreased by 10% in relation of POWER MODE
   - Damage increased by 35% in relation of SPEED MODE
   - Defense decreased
   - Takes a longer time to fill the Super Bar
   - Can use Chain-Combos
       - c: this hit can be canceled in any Special Moves / DMs / SDMs / Shuuen no mai
       - j: this hit can juggle
       - #: this hit can't be canceled
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in DMs / SDMs
   - Desperation Moves a needs Super Bar in MAX / FLASHING Life Bar
   - Super Desperation Moves needs a Super Bar in MAX and a FLASHING Life Bar
   - Shuuen no mai needs a Super Bar in MAX and a FLASHING Life Bar

