$cmd
Marvel Super Heroes                                         © 1995 Capcom
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^E : Weak Punch (_P)
^F : Medium Punch (_P)
^G : Strong Punch (_P)
^H : Weak Kick (_K)
^I : Medium Kick (_K)
^J : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Cycle Gems

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Infinity Special
_# Infinity Gem Power Exclusive

_` Infinity Special
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

- INFINITY GEM POWER -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` POWER GEM
   - Damage increased
   - Can cause block damage with normal attacks

_` SPACE GEM
   - Super Armor
   - Defense increased by 50%
   - Don't takes block damage

_` TIME GEM
   - Speed up

_` SOUL GEM
   - Refills 2 blocks of Life Bar

_` MIND GEM
   - Refills almost 2LVs of Super Bar.

_` REALITY GEM
   - Can throw projectiles
     - High Fireballs              ^E
     - Low Fireballs               ^H
     - Icicles Down                ^F
     - Icicles Up                  ^I
     - Slow Electrical Spheres     ^G
     - Fast Electrical Spheres     ^J
     - Pumpkins                    _S

- COMBO INFO -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Ground Chain-Combo
   - Type of the chain-combo that can be done on the floor
_` Jump Chain-Combo
   - Type of the chain-combo that can be done on jump
_` Super Jump Chain-Combo
   - Type of the chain-combo that can be done on Super Jump

_` Chain-Combos
   - Punch-to-Kick
     ^E _! ^H             ^F _! ^H               ^G _! ^H
     ^E _! ^I             ^F _! ^I               ^G _! ^I
     ^E _! ^J             ^F _! ^J               ^G _! ^J
   - Kick-to-Punch
     ^H _! ^E             ^I _! ^E               ^J _! ^E
     ^H _! ^F             ^I _! ^F               ^J _! ^F
     ^H _! ^G             ^I _! ^G               ^J _! ^G
   - Weak Start
     ^E _! ^F             ^H _! ^F
     ^E _! ^I             ^H _! ^I
     ^E _! ^G             ^H _! ^G
     ^E _! ^J             ^H _! ^J
   - Stronger
     ^E _! ^F _! ^G               ^H _! ^F _! ^G
     ^E _! ^F _! ^J               ^H _! ^F _! ^J
     ^E _! ^I _! ^G               ^H _! ^I _! ^G
     ^E _! ^I _! ^J               ^H _! ^I _! ^J
   - Zig-Zag
     ^E _! ^H _! ^F _! ^I _! ^G _! ^J

_` Strikes
   - Move that launches opponent straight forward
_` Knockdowns
   - Move that knock down opponent
_` Launchers
   - Move that launches opponent to Air Combo
   - Press _8 to Super Jump
_` Air Launchers
   - Move that launches opponent to Air Combo if the opponent is already in the air
   - Press _8 to Super Jump
_` Air Combo Finishers
   - Move that finishes the Air Combo starting the "Flying Screen Animation"
_` Infinity Counter
   - Move used during a Infinity Counter
_` Super Bar Max Level
   - Max Level of Super Bar

