- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Change Battle Order
   - On the vs. Screen _O^U

_` Use Opponent's Special Partner
   - On the vs. Screen _O^T

_` CPU Battles
    _` Fight "Orange" Hulk and Wolverine on Stage 7
       - Don't lose any character
       - Win 3 matches with Hyper Combos
    _` Fight "Golden" War Machine and Captain America on Stage 7
       - Don't lose any character
       - Win 3 matches with Hyper Combos
       - Win 2 matches with Variable Cross
    _` Fight "Red" Venom and Spider-Man on Stage 7
       - Don't lose any character
       - Get a "First Attack" in 6 matches
       - Win 2 matches with Hyper Combos
       - Win 4 matches with Variable Cross
    _` Fight Morrigan "Lilith Style" and Chun-Li on Stage 7
       - Don't lose any character
       - Use all the Special Partner stock in 2 matches
       - Win 3 matches with Hyper Combos
    _` Fight Roll and Megaman on Stage 7
       - Don't lose any character
       - Use all the Special Partner stock in 6 matches
       - Win 3 matches with Hyper Combos
       - Win 2 matches with Variable Cross
    _` Fight Shadow Lady and Jin on Stage 7
       - Don't lose any character
       - Get a "First Attack" in 6 matches
       - Use all the Special Partner stock in 6 matches
       - Win 2 matches with Hyper Combos
       - Win 4 matches with Variable Cross
$end

