- SECRET CHARACTERS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Unlocks Secret Characters and New Colors (USA / Euro / Asia only)
   - Arcade will level up every 400 experience points
   - Every Level Up, a new random Character or 2 new Colors for a random character will be unlocked
     - Levels 01, 07, 13 and 19 unlocks Omega Red, Psylocke, Rogue and Storm
     - Levels 04, 10, 16 and 22 unlocks Cammy, Jill, Sakura and Tron Bonne
     - Levels 25, 31, 37 and 43 unlocks Iron Man, Silver Samurai, War Machine and Adamantium-less Wolverine
     - Levels 28, 34, 40 and 46 unlocks Chun-Li, Bison, Megaman and Roll
     - Levels 49, 55, 61 and 67 unlocks Blackheart, Colossus, Sabretooth and Spiral
     - Levels 52, 58, 64 and 70 unlocks Charlie, Dan, Dhalsim and Ken
     - Levels 73 and 79 unlocks Felicia and Servbot
     - Levels 76 and 82 unlocks Sentinel and Thanos
     - Any Other Levels unlocks Colors

_` Level Up with Operator's Code (USA / Euro / Asia only)
   - Go to Level 24 (8 Characters and 2 new Colors for 16 Characters)
     - On the Game Test Mode, go to GAME CONFIGURATION, then put the cursor on DEMO SOUND HALF and press _b_a^J^G^H^E
   - Go to Level 48 (8 Characters and 2 new Colors for 16 Characters)
     - On the Game Test Mode, go to GAME CONFIGURATION, then put the cursor on DAMAGE LEVEL and press ^J_b_a^J^G^J
   - Go to Level 72 (8 Characters and 2 new Colors for 16 Characters)
     - On the Game Test Mode, go to GAME CONFIGURATION, then put the cursor on CONTINUE and press ^E^G^E_a^H^G
   - Go to Level 84 (4 Characters and 2 new Colors for 8 Characters)
     - On the Game Test Mode, go to GAME CONFIGURATION, then put the cursor on DIFFICULTY and press ^G^H_a^E_b^E

_` Unlocks Everything with Operator's Code (Japan only)
   - Unlocks 10 random Characters and 2 new Colors for 10 Characters
     - On the Game Test Mode, go to GAME CONFIGURATION, then put the cursor on SOUND MODE and press ^H^G_b_a^J^E
   - Unlocks 10 random Characters and 2 new Colors for 10 Characters
     - On the Game Test Mode, go to GAME CONFIGURATION, then put the cursor on DIFFICULTY and press ^J^G_a_b^E^H
   - Unlocks 8 random Characters and 2 new Colors for 13 Characters
     - On the Game Test Mode, go to GAME CONFIGURATION, then put the cursor on DAMAGE LEVEL and press ^E^G^J_b_a^H
   - Unlocks 2 new Colors for 23 Characters
     - On the Game Test Mode, go to GAME CONFIGURATION, then put the cursor on TIMER SPEED and press ^G^H_a^J_b^E

