- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Color Select
   - 1st Color, select the character with ^E
   - 2nd Color, select the character with ^G
   - 3rd Color, select the character with ^H
   - 4th Color, select the character with ^J
   - 5th Color, select the character with _a (must be unlocked first)
   - 6th Color, select the character with _b (must be unlocked first)

_` Change Battle Order
   - On the vs. Screen _O_a for start with your 2nd character
   - On the vs. Screen _O_b for start with your 3rd character

_` Dan's Explosion
   - Choose Dan as your 1st character
   - On the vs. Screen _O^E
$end

