- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Stress Shot
_& Ippatsu Ougi
_> Kinjite

_` Shadow Moves
   - Moves with (S) have a Shadow Version
   - Do the Move when dashing

_` Stress Shot
   - Needs 1LV of Stress Gauge

_` Ippatsu Ougi
   - Needs 2LVs of Stress Gauge

_` Kinjite
   - Needs 3LVs of Stress Gauge

