SLUG DIGGER
Shot                                                                     _A
Cannon                                                                   _C

- CHARACTERS SPECIAL ABILITY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Marco Rossi
   - Damage for Pistol increased by 100% (Heavy Machine Gun on Easy Mode)

_` Tarma Roving
   - Vehicle damage increased by 50%
   - Vehicle defense increased by 100%

_` Fiolina "Fio" Germi
   - Start the Mission with a Heavy Machine Gun (Big Heavy Machine Gun on Easy Mode)
   - Ammo increased by 50%

_` Eri Kasamoto
   - Grenade Ammo incresed by 100%
   - Can aim her grenades

_` Ralf Jones
   - Has double Life
   - Has 50% less ammo
   - Vulcan Punch: _8_+_A_+_D

_` Clark Still
   - Super Argentine Backbreaker: close _8_+_A_+_D

- WEAPON LIST-
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` WEAPONS (Hard Mode)
   - Pistol                              ∞
   - Grenade                             10
   - Firebomb                            10
   - Heavy Machine Gun                   100
   - Big Heavy Machine Gun               100
   - Rocket Launcher                     10
   - Big Rocket Launcher                 10
   - Shotgun                             10
   - Big Shotgun                         10
   - Flame Shot                          10
   - Big Flame Shot                      10
   - Laser Gun                           100
   - Big Laser Gun                       100
   - Enemy Chaser                        10
   - Iron Lizard                         10
   - Drop Shot                           10
   - Super Grenade                       10
   - Two Machine Guns                    200
   - Zantetsu Sword                      10

