        - Player 1 Half Power                                                 033 - 000
        - Player 2 Half Power                                                 000 - 033
        - Player 1 Quarter Power                                              707 - 000
        - Player 2 Quarter Power                                              000 - 707
     _` Game Play Altering Kodes
        - Blocking Disabled                                                   020 - 020
        - Throwing Disabled                                                   100 - 100
        - Unlimited Run                                                       466 - 466
        - No Powerbars                                                        987 - 123
        - Dark Kombat                                                         688 - 422
        - Randper Kombat                                                      460 - 460
        - Psycho Kombat                                                       985 - 125
        - You Are Entering The Land of Rellim (Galaxian)                      642 - 468
     _` Winner of This Round Fights Kodes
