        - Winner of This Round Battles Noob Saibot                            769 - 342
        - Winner of This Round Battles Motaro                                 969 - 141
        - Winner of This Round Battles Shao Kahn                              033 - 564
     _` Text Message Kodes
        - No Fear = EB Button, Skydive, Max Countdown                         282 - 282
        - There Is No Knowledge That Is Not Power                             123 - 926
        - Hold Flippers During Casino Run                                     987 - 666
   - Only on a 2P Game
