Mortal Kombat 4 (version 3.0)                               © 1997 Midway
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^G : High Punch
^E : Low Punch
_G : Block
^J : High Kick
^H : Low Kick
@R-button : Run
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_# Draw Weapon Move (repeat to throw the weapon)
_@ Special Moves

_` Finishing Moves
   _` Fatality
      - After winning the match
   - Stage Fatality: Goro's Lair
      - After winning the match on Goro's Lair Stage
      - Must be done close
      - After the Fatality _O_G to hear Dan Forden say "Toasty"
      - After the Fatality ^2 to take down the opponent of the Spikes
   - Stage Fatality: The Prison
      - After winning the match on The Prison Stage
      - Must be done close

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Throw                                                                 close ^E
_( Break Move                                                            close ^H

_) Uppercut                                                              _2_+^G
