_) Roundhouse                                                            _4_+^J
_) Sidestep In                                                           @R-button @R-button
_) Sidestep Out                                                          ^2_+@R-button @R-button
_) Avoid Throw / Break Move                                              when thrown ^4
_) Pick Up Object                                                        close to object _2_+@R-button
_) Pick Up Weapon                                                        close to weapon _2_+@R-button

