$info=mk4a,mk4b
$cmd
Mortal Kombat 4 (version 1.0/version 2.1)                   © 1997 Midway
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^G : High Punch
^E : Low Punch
_G : Block
^J : High Kick
^H : Low Kick
@R-button : Run
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_# Draw Weapon Move (repeat to throw the weapon) (Throw weapon on version 2.1 only)
_@ Special Moves

_` Finishing Moves
   _` Fatality
      - After winning the match
   - Stage Fatality: The Prison
      - After winning the match on The Prison Stage
      - Must be done close

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Throw                                                                 close ^E
_( Break Move                                                            close ^H

_) Uppercut                                                              _2_+^G
_) Sweep                                                                 _4_+^H
_) Roundhouse                                                            _4_+^J
_) Sidestep In                                                           @R-button @R-button (version 2.1 only)
_) Sidestep Out                                                          ^2_+@R-button @R-button (version 2.1 only)
_) Avoid Throw / Break Move                                              when thrown ^4
_) Pick Up Object                                                        close to object _2_+@R-button (version 2.1 only)
_) Pick Up Weapon                                                        close to weapon _2_+@R-button

Kombos
3-hits (20%): ^G^J_2_+^J (juggle) (version 2.1 only)

