NeoGeo Battle Coliseum                                © 2005 SNK Playmore
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
@E-button : Tag Out
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves (DM)
_# Special D-Assault

_` Desperation Moves (DM)
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

_# Special D-Assaults
   - Needs D-ASSAULT OK!
   - Needs the Specific Partner
   - Has 10 seconds after doing the special condition listed

_` Super Cancel
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in DMs

_` Wire Whip System
   - Moves with (C) are Counter Wire, the opponent will bounce off the wall if hit on Counter

