- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Boss Battle
   _` Fight Mizuchi after Time Over
      - Don't meet any requirements below
   _` Fight King Lion after Time Over
      - Win 6 battles
      - Use 1 Bonus Service
      - Don't use any D-Assault
   _` Fight Neo-Dio after Time Over
      - Don't lose any battle
      - Win 6 battles
      - Use 2 Bonus Service
      - Use 4 D-Assault
   _` Fight Goodman after Time Over
      - Don't lose any battle
      - Win 8 battles
      - Don't use Bonus Service
      - Use 6 D-Assault
      - The combined Life Bar of both characters should be one FULL Life Bar
$end

