$info=ninjamas
$cmd
Ninja Master's: Haoh-ninpo-cho                                 © 1996 SNK
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Strong Punch (_P)
_C : Weak Kick (_K)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Start
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Super Moves
_& Desperation Moves
_> Finishing Moves
_# Super Chains

_` Weapon System
   - Moves with (W) needs the weapon to be used
   - Moves with (N) can only be done with bare hands

_` EX Moves
   - Moves with (EX) have a EX Version
   - Do the Move with _A_+_B / _C_+_D
   - Needs Super Bar in MAX / Hyper Mode Activated (not spends the gauge)

_` Super Moves
   - Needs a Super Bar in MAX / Hyper Mode Activated

_` Desperation Moves
   - Needs a FLASHING Life Bar / Hyper Mode Activated

_` Finishing Moves
   - Needs a Super Bar in MAX / Hyper Mode Activated
   - Opponent's Life Bar must be FLASHING

_` Super Chains
   - Needs a Super Bar in MAX / Hyper Mode Activated

