Ragnagard                                                   © 1996 Saurus
Shin-Oh-Ken
Rebuilt by: Fabricio Coroquer (Created by: t65will)

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Light Punch (_P)
_B : Light Kick (_K)
_C : Heavy Punch (_P)
_D : Heavy Kick (_K)
_S : Start
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves
_& Super Desperation Moves

_` Special Moves
   - Special Moves with (F) become powerful with the FIRE Elemental Bar FULL
   - Special Moves with (B) become powerful with the BREEZE Elemental Bar FULL
   - Special Moves with (T) become powerful with the THUNDER Elemental Bar FULL
   - Special Moves with (W) become powerful with the WATER Elemental Bar FULL

_` Desperation Moves
   - Desperation Moves with (F) needs 1 FIRE Symbol on Elemental Gauge
   - Desperation Moves with (B) needs 1 BREEZE Symbol on Elemental Gauge
   - Desperation Moves with (T) needs 1 THUNDER Symbol on Elemental Gauge
   - Desperation Moves with (W) needs 1 WATER Symbol on Elemental Gauge

_` Super Desperation Moves
   - Needs 3 Symbols of any element on Elemental Gauge / FLASHING Life Bar

