─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@F-button : Fire
_B : Bomb
_S : Start

- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Raiden MK-II Beta
   - After insert coins _O@F-button and press _S
   - On the Fighter Select Screen, put the cursor on Random Select ^6 and press @F-button

_` Blue Javelin
   - After insert coins _O@F-button and press _S
   - On the Fighter Select Screen, put the cursor on Random Select ^2 and press @F-button

_` Miclus
   - After insert coins _O@F-button and press _S
   - On the Fighter Select Screen, put the cursor on Random Select ^3 and press @F-button

_` Aegis II-C
   - After insert coins _O@F-button and press _S
   - On the Fighter Select Screen, put the cursor on Aegis IV ^8 and press @F-button

_` Fairy
   - After insert coins _O@F-button _+ _B and press _S
   - On the Fighter Select Screen, put the cursor on Random Select ^3 and press @F-button

_` Slave
   - After insert coins _O@F-button _+ _B and press _S
   - On the Fighter Select Screen, press @F-button

_` Unlocks Raiden MK-II Beta, Blue Javelin, Miclus and Aegis II-C with Operator's Code
   - On the Test Menu, go to GAME SETTINGS and turns SHOOTER1" and SHOOTER2 to 9COIN(S) / 9CREDIT(S)
   - Turn FREE PLAY to ON
   - Go to I/O TEST and hold Test Switch (F2) and Service Switch (9)
   - Press _S on 2P side until DAYS OF OPERATION counter is set above 140
   - Exit the Test Menu and reboot the machine
$end

