Raiden Fighters Jet                                 © 1998 Seibu Kaihatsu
Raiden Fighters Jet 2000                            © 2000 Seibu Kaihatsu
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@F-button : Fire
_B : Bomb
_S : Start

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Charged Fire                                                             _O@F-button
Delayed Bomb                                                             _O_B

- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Slave
   - After insert coins _O_B and press _S
   - On the Fighter Select Screen, press @F-button without release _B

_` Special Stage with Operator's Code
   - On Test Mode, go to GAME SETTINGS and turns SPECIAL STAGE to ON
$end

###################################################################################################

$info=rbff1,rbff1a,rbff1k,rbff1ka
$cmd
Real Bout Fatal Fury                                           © 1995 SNK
Real Bout Garou Densetsu
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Punch
_B : Kick
_C : Powerful Attack
_D : Plane Switch
_S : Start
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Super Power (S.POWER)
_& Potential Power (P.POWER)

_` Plane System
   - Moves with (M) pulls the opponent to Main Plane
   - Moves with (B) pushes the opponent to Back Plane
   - Moves with (F) pushes the opponent to Front Plane
   - Moves with (A) hit all planes

_` Guard Cancel Moves
   - Moves with (G) can be used when blocking
   - Needs ½ Super Bar

_` Super Power (S.POWER)
   - Needs a FULL Super Bar / FLASHING Life Bar

_` Potential Power (P.POWER)
   - Needs a FULL Super Bar and a FLASHING Life Bar

_` Combos
   - c = this hit can be canceled in any Special Moves / S.POWER / P.POWER
   - j = this hit can juggle
   - # = this hit can't be canceled
   - B = this hit pushes the opponent to Back Plane
   - F = this hit pushes the opponent to Front Plane

