$info=rbffspec,rbffspeck
$cmd
Real Bout Fatal Fury Special                                   © 1997 SNK
Real Bout Garou Densetsu Special
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Punch
_B : Kick
_C : Powerful Attack
_D : Plane Switch
_S : Start
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Super Power (S.POWER)
_& Potential Power (P.POWER)

_` Plane System
   - Moves with (Y) pulls the opponent to Your Plane
   - Moves with (P) pushes the opponent to Other Plane
   - Moves with (A) hit all planes

_` Break Shot Moves
   - Moves with (BS) can be used when blocking
   - Needs ½ Super Bar (H.POWER)

_` Super Power (S.POWER)
   - Needs a FULL Super Bar / FLASHING Life Bar

_` Potential Power (P.POWER)
   - Needs a FULL Super Bar and a FLASHING Life Bar

_` Combos
   - c = this hit can be canceled in any Special Moves / S.POWER / P.POWER
   - j = this hit can juggle
   - # = this hit can't be canceled
   - P = this hit pushes the opponent to Other Plane
   - Y = this hit pulls the opponent to Your Plane

