- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^E : Light Punch (_P)
^H : Light Kick (_K)
^G : Strong Punch (_P)
^J : Strong Kick (_K)
_D : Dodge
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Offensive Art
_& Defensive Art
_> Critical Art

_` Critical Cancel
   - Moves with (!) can be Critical Canceled in Offensive Art / Critical Art

_` Offensive Art
   - Needs a FULL Offense Gauge

_` Defensive Art
   - Needs a FULL Defense Gauge

_` Critical Art
   - Needs a FULL Offense Gauge and a FULL Defense Gauge

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) (-) Run                                                               _6^6
_) (-) Retreat                                                           _4_4
_) (-) High Jump                                                         _1_9
_) (-) Throw                                                             close _4 / _6_+^G
