- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Slash (^s)
_B : Medium Slash (^s)
_C : Strong Slash (^s)
_D : Kick
_S : Start
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Weapon-Flipping Techniques

_` Weapon System
   - Moves with (W) needs the weapon to be used

_` Weapon-Flipping Techniques
   - Needs a Super Bar in MAX

