Samurai Shodown IV: Amakusa's Revenge                          © 1996 SNK
Samurai Spirits: Amakusa Kourin
Pae Wang Jeon Seol
Legend of a Warrior
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Slash (^s)
_B : Medium Slash (^s)
_C : Strong Slash (^s)
_D : Kick
_S : Start
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Weapon-Flipping Techniques
_& No Contest

_` Weapon System
   - Moves with (W) needs the weapon to be used

_` Powerful Moves
   - Moves with (P) have a Powered Version with Super Bar in MAX (not spends the gauge)

_` Weapon-Flipping Techniques
   - Needs a Super Bar in MAX / Ikari Bakuhatsu Activated

_` No Contest
   - Defeat the opponent with a slash attack that just push him/her forward
   - Can't use the No Contest against Nakoruru, Rimururu, CPU Amakusa, CPU Zankuro and the last CPU opponent

