- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Boss Battle
   _` Fight Amakusa on Stage 7, Zankuro on Stage 8 and your Last Boss on Stage 9 (Good Ending)
      - Complete the Stage 6 within your character's time limit
   _` Fight your Last Boss on Stage 7 (Bad Ending)
      - Complete the Stage 6 after your character's time limit
