- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Slash (^s)
_B : Medium Slash (^s)
_C : Kick
_D : Meditation
_S : Start
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Weapon-Flipping Techniques
_& Zetsumei Ougi

_` Weapon System
   - Moves with (W) needs the weapon to be used

_` Weapon-Flipping Techniques
   - Needs a Super Bar in MAX / Ikari Bakuhatsu Activated

_` Zetsumei Ougi
   - Needs Ikari Bakuhatsu Activated
   - On winning round, the opponent's life must be blue

