Samurai Shodown VI                                    © 2005 SNK Playmore
Samurai Spirits: Tenkaichi Kenkakuden
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Slash (^s)
_B : Medium Slash (^s)
_C : Strong Slash (^s)
_D : Kick
@E-button : Special
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Weapon-Breaking Techniques / Weapon-Flipping Techniques
_# Nuigurumi
_& Hidden Super Specials

_` Weapon System
   - Moves with (W) needs the weapon to be used

- SPIRITS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` SPIRIT I (怒 Rage)
   - Damage decreased by 5% in relation with the SPIRIT VI
   - Damage increased by 50% with Super Bar in MAX

_` SPIRIT II (真 True)
   - Damage increased by 10% in relation with the SPIRIT VI
   - Damage increased by 5% with Super Bar in MAX
   - Weapon-Breaking Techniques needs a Super Bar in MAX
   - Can use Nuigurumi
   - Can use Hidden Super Specials (once per round)

_` SPIRIT III (斬 Behead)
   - Damage increased by 5% in relation with the SPIRIT VI
   - Damage increased by 10% with Super Bar in MAX
   - Weapon-Flipping Techniques needs a Super Bar in MAX / FLASHING Life Bar

_` SPIRIT IV (天 Heaven)
   - Damage increased by 5% in relation with the SPIRIT VI
   - Damage increased by 5% with Super Bar in MAX
   - Damage increased by 10% with Ikari Bakuhatsu
   - Weapon-Flipping Techniques needs a Super Bar in MAX / Ikari Bakuhatsu Activated

_` SPIRIT V (零 Null)
   - Damage increased by 15% in relation with the SPIRIT VI
   - Damage increased by 10% with Super Bar in MAX
   - Damage increased by 30% with Ikari Bakuhatsu
   - Weapon-Flipping Techniques needs a Super Bar in MAX / Ikari Bakuhatsu Activated

_` SPIRIT VI (剣 Sword)
   - Damage decreased by 5% with Super Bar in MAX
   - Weapon-Flipping Techniques needs a Super Bar in MAX
   - Can use Hidden Super Specials, needs a Green Life bar

