$info=sams64
$cmd
Samurai Shodown 64                                             © 1997 SNK
Samurai Spirits 64
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Attack
_B : Strong Attack
_C : Throw
_D : 3D Movement
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Hidden Super Specials

_` Hidden Super Specials
   - Needs a Super Bar in MAX / Ikari Bakuhatsu Activated

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Defense Breaker                                                       close _C_C

_) Dash                                                                  _6_6 / _6_+_D
_) Run                                                                   _6^6 / ^6_+_D
_) Retreat                                                               _4_4 / _4_+_D
_) Normal Jump                                                           _8
_) Low Jump                                                              _X_8
_) Sidestep Left                                                         _D
_) Sidestep Right                                                        _2_+_D
_) 3D Movement                                                           ^2 / ^8_+_D
_) Combo Slash                                                           _C_+_D
_)   ^!Chain Combo 1                                                     _A_A_A_A_A_A_A_A_A_A_A
_)   ^!Chain Combo 2                                                     _A_A_A_A_A_A_A_A_B_B_B
_)   ^!Chain Combo 3                                                     _A_A_A_A_B_B_B_B_A_A_A
_)   ^!Chain Combo 4                                                     _A_A_A_A_B_B_B_B_B_B_B
_)   ^!Chain Combo 5                                                     _B_B_B_B_A_A_A_A_A_A_A
_)   ^!Chain Combo 6                                                     _B_B_B_B_A_A_A_A_B_B_B
_)   ^!Chain Combo 7                                                     _B_B_B_B_B_B_B_B_A_A_A
_)   ^!Chain Combo 8                                                     _B_B_B_B_B_B_B_B_B_B_B
_) Throw Escape                                                          when thrown _C
_) Roll Backward                                                         knocked down _4
_) Roll Forward                                                          knocked down _6
_) Roll Left                                                             knocked down _8
_) Roll Right                                                            knocked down _2
_) Ikari Bakuhatsu (MAX)                                                 _A_+_B_+_C
_)   ^!Issen                                                             _A_+_B_+_C / _B_+_C_+_D

- HAOHMARU -                                                             SLASH
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_@ Ougi Senpuu Retsu Zan                                                 _2_3_6_+_B
