Samurai Shodown: Warrior's Rage                                © 1998 SNK
Samurai Spirits 2: Asura Zanmaden
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Attack
_B : Medium Attack
_C : Strong Attack
_D : 3D Movement
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Hidden Super Specials

_` Powerful Moves
   - Moves with (P) have a Powered Version
   - Do a Special Move with _A_+_B
   - Needs Super Bar in MAX (not spends the gauge)

_` Hidden Super Specials
   - Needs a Super Bar in MAX / Ikari Bakuhatsu Activated

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( (─) Throw                                                             close _6_+_C
_( (─)   ^!Defense Breaker                                               ^4 / ^6

_) (─) Dash                                                              _6_6 / _6_+_D
_) (─) Run                                                               _6^6 / ^6_+_D
_) (─) Retreat                                                           _4_4 / _4_+_D
_) (─) Sidestep Left                                                     _D
_) (─) Sidestep Right                                                    _2_+_D
_) (─) Combo Slash                                                       _C_+_D
_) (─)   ^!Chain Combo 1                                                 _A_A_A
_) (─)   ^!Chain Combo 2                                                 _B_B_B
_) (─)   ^!Deadly Chain                                                  _A_A_B_B_C_C_A_B_C
_) (─) Throw Escape                                                      when thrown _C
_) (─) Roll Backward                                                     knocked down _4
_) (─) Roll Forward                                                      knocked down _6
_) (─) Roll Left                                                         knocked down _8
_) (─) Roll Right                                                        knocked down _2
_) (─) Ikari Bakuhatsu                                                   _A_+_B_+_C
_) (─)   ^!Issen                                                         _A_+_B_+_C / _B_+_C_+_D

