$info=svc,svcpcb,svcpcba
$cmd
SNK vs. Capcom: SVC Chaos                                 © 2003 Playmore
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Weak Punch (_P)
_B : Weak Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves (DM)
_& Exceed Moves

_` Desperation Moves (DM)
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar / MAXIMUM Mode Activated

_` Exceed Moves
   - Needs a FLASHING Life Bar
   - only 1 for match

_` MAXIMUM MODE
   - Can use Guard Cancels and DMs without a LV
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in DMs / Exceeds
   - Can cancel a normal attack in any Special Moves that have a (I)
   - Can cancel a Command Move / Special Move with (O) in any Command Move / Special Move with (I)

