- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Roulette
   - On the Character Select Screen _O_S

_` CPU Battles
   _` Fight Goenitz or Dan Hibiki on Stage 4
      - Don't meet any requirements below
   _` Fight Geese Howard or Demitri Maximoff on Stage 4
      - Don't lose any round
      - Never win by Time Out
      - Win 1 round with Exceed
   _` Fight Mars People or Zero on Stage 4
      - Don't lose any round
      - Never win by Time Out
      - Win 3 round with Exceed
   _` Fight Orochi Iori on Stage 7 and Serious Mr. Karate on Stage 8 
      - Fight with a Capcom Character on Stage 6
   _` Fight Violent Ken on Stage 7 and Shin Akuma on Stage 8
      - Fight with a SNK Character on Stage 6
   _` Fight Athena on Stage 9
      - Don't lose any round (Stage 1 through Stage 7)
      - Never win by Block Damage
   _` Fight Red Arremer on Stage 9
      - Don't lose any round (Stage 1 through Stage 7)
      - Win 5 rounds with Special Moves
      - Win 1 round by Block Damage
$end

