- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_a : Horizontal Attack
_b : Vertical Attack
_K : Kick
_G : Guard
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Throws
_) Command Moves
_* Critical Edge Moves

_` Critical Edge Moves
   - Needs ⅓ of Sword Bar

_` "~" between 2 buttons
   - Press the 2nd button immediately after the 1st button

_` String Moves
   - h = High Level Attack
   - m = Mid Level Attack
   - l = Low Level Attack
   - g = Hits Knocked Down Opponent
   - ! = Unblockable Move

