Soul Calibur                                                 © 1998 Namco
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_a : Horizontal Attack
_b : Vertical Attack
_K : Kick
_G : Guard
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Throws
_) Command Moves

_` "~" between 2 buttons
   - Press the 2nd button immediately after the 1st button

_` String Moves
   - h = High Level Attack
   - m = Mid Level Attack
   - l = Low Level Attack
   - H = High Level Attack/hit opponent knocked down
   - M = Mid Level Attack/hit opponent knocked down
   - L = Low Level Attack/hit opponent knocked down
   - ! = Unblockable Move
   - - = No Hit

_` Positions
   - 8W = 8 Way Run
   - BK = Back Turned

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) 8 WAY RUN: 8W                                                         _?_N_? (same direction)
_) Crawl Forward                                                         ^3
_) Crawl Backward                                                        ^1
_) Sidestep                                                              _?
_) Normal Jump                                                           _O_G_8
_) High/Mid Deflects                                                     _6_+_G
_) Mid/Low Deflects                                                      _3_+_G
_) High/Mid Parries                                                      _4_+_G
_) High/Mid Parries                                                      _1_+_G
_) Throw Escape                                                          when thrown _a (_a_+_G / _K_+_G throw)
_) Throw Escape                                                          when thrown _b (_b_+_G / _a_+_b throw)
_) Tech Roll                                                             being knocked down _G
_) Get Up                                                                knocked down _G
_) Roll Forward                                                          knocked down _6
_) Roll Backward                                                         knocked down _4
_) Roll Out                                                              knocked down _2
_) Roll In                                                               knocked down _8
_) Rising Attack                                                         knocked down _a / _b
_) Rising Kick                                                           knocked down _K
_) Soul Charge                                                           _a_+_b_+_K
