- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Light Slash (^s)
_B : Medium Slash (^s)
_C : Heavy Slash (^s)
_D : Kick
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Super Skill Moves
_& Final Impact Moves

_` Super Skill Moves
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` Final Impact Moves
   - Needs 3LVs of Super Bar

_` Chaos Cancel
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in Super Skill Moves / Final Impact Moves

_` Seal of Time
   - Moves with (S) can be canceled in a Seal of Time
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` BURST MODE
   - Defense increased
   - Block damage increased
   - Can cause Guard Crush more easily
   - Can use Super Skill Moves, Final Impact Moves, Seal of Time and Guard Attack without a LV

