- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Super Arts

_` EX Moves
   - Moves with (EX) have a EX Version
   - Do the Move with ^W / ^V
   - Needs a small amount of Super Bar

_` Super Arts
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` Super Cancel
   - Moves with (!) can be Super Canceled in Super Arts

_` Target Combos
   - c = this hit can be canceled in any Special Moves / Super Arts
   - ! = this hit can be Super Canceled in Super Arts
   - j = this hit can juggle
   - # = this hit can't be canceled

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) (-/──) Dash                                                           _6_6
