- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Color Select
   - 1st Color, select the character with ^E
   - 2nd Color, select the character with ^F
   - 3rd Color, select the character with ^G
   - 4th Color, select the character with ^H
   - 5th Color, select the character with ^I
   - 6th Color, select the character with ^J (original color)
   - 7th Color, select the character with ^H_+^G

_` Course Select
   - On the Super Art Select Screen press:
     - Course 1          _6_+_P
     - Course 2          _6_+_K
     - Course 3          _4_+_P
     - Course 4          _4_+_K

_` Bonus Game LV Select
   - On the Start of the Bonus Stage press:
     - LV1               _O^H
     - LV2               _O^I
     - LV3               _O^J
     - LV4               _O^T
     - LV5               ^2_+_O^E_+^I_+^G

_` CPU Battles
   _` Fight a Mid-Boss after Stage 4, 5 or 6
      - Don't lose any round
      - Win 5 rounds with Super Arts
   _` Fight Akuma on Stage 8
      - Don't lose any round
      - Get 2 Perfects
   _` Fight Shin Akuma after Akuma on Stage 8
      - Don't lose any round
      - Get 3 Perfects
      - Never get more than 3 "Block Damage Wins"
      - When fighting Akuma never get a Judgement Win or Time Out Win
      - When fighting Akuma win 1 round with Super Art or Perfect
$end

