_` Color Select
   - 1st Color, select the character with ^E
   - 2nd Color, select the character with ^F
   - 3rd Color, select the character with ^G
   - 4th Color, select the character with ^H
   - 5th Color, select the character with ^I
   - 6th Color, select the character with ^J
   - 7th Color, select the character with ^E_+^I_+^G

_` Fight Q after Stage 7
   - Don't lose any round
   - Win 5 rounds with Super Arts
   - Get 2 SP Point
   - Never get a grade G, F or E

_` Bonus Game LV Select
   - On the Start of the Parry Bonus Stage press:
     - Normal LV1          ^2_+_O^H
     - Normal LV2          ^2_+_O^I
     - Normal LV3          ^2_+_O^J
     - Normal LV4          ^2_+_O^T
     - Normal LV5          ^2_+_O^E_+^I_+^G
     - Hard LV1            ^8_+_O^H
     - Hard LV2            ^8_+_O^I
