   - Level 2 Super Combos must be done with ^W / ^V and needs 2LVs of Super Bar
   - Level 3 Super Combos must be done with ^U / ^T and needs 3LVs of Super Bar
   - Custom Combos needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` Alpha Counters
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

