- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^E : Weak Punch (_P)
^F : Medium Punch (_P)
^G : Strong Punch (_P)
^H : Weak Kick (_K)
^I : Medium Kick (_K)
^J : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Super Combos / Custom Combos
_# Alpha Counters

_` Super Combos / Custom Combos
   - Level 1 Super Combos needs 1LV of Super Bar
   - Level 2 Super Combos must be done with ^W / ^V and needs 2LVs of Super Bar
   - Level 3 Super Combos must be done with ^U / ^T and needs 3LVs of Super Bar
   - Custom Combos needs 1LV of Super Bar

_` Alpha Counters
   - Needs 1½LV of Super Bar

