- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Sakura "Special Colors"
   - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Sakura, press _S_S_S_S_S, then press _P / _K
   - 6 different colors

_` Fight a Mid-Boss after Stage 5 or 6
   - Don't lose any round
   - Win 5 matches with Super Combos / Custom Combos (can be only 1 Super Combo / Custom Combo per round)

_` Fight Shin Akuma on Stage 8 (1P side)
   - Select your character with any _P
   - Don't lose any round
   - Win 3 rounds with Perfect

_` Fight Shin Akuma on Stage 8 (2P side)
   - Select your character with any _K
   - Don't lose any round
   - Win 3 rounds with Perfect

_` Survival Mode
   - After insert coins _O^U and press _S

_` Dramatic Battle Mode
   - After insert coins _O^T and press _S

_` Shin Akuma Mode
   - After insert coins _O^F_+^I and press _S

_` Stage Select
   - Must start a 1P Game and after the match begins, the 2nd Player must join in (Here Comes a New Challenger)
   _` Normal Stage
      - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on character who want to select the stage _O_S for 5 seconds
      - Release _S and select your character
   _` Grass "Australia" Stage
      - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Sagat _O_S for 5 seconds
      - Select your character without release _S
   _` Walterfall "Venezuela" Stage
      - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Bison _O_S for 5 seconds
      - Select your character without release _S
$end

