Street Fighter Alpha 3                                      © 1998 Capcom
Street Fighter Zero 3
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^E : Weak Punch (_P)
^F : Medium Punch (_P)
^G : Strong Punch (_P)
^H : Weak Kick (_K)
^I : Medium Kick (_K)
^J : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Super Combos / Custom Combos
_# Alpha Counters

_` ISMs System
   - Moves with (X) can only be done on X-ISM
   - Moves with (A) can only be done on A-ISM
   - Moves with (V) can only be done on V-ISM

- ISMs -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` X-ISM (Simple Mode)
   - Damage increased by 15% (not for Super Combos)
   - Defense decreased by 15%
   - Super Bar Max Level 1
   - Guard Gauge is 10% bigger
   - Can't use Air Blocking
   - Super Combos needs a FULL Super Bar

_` A-ISM (Standard Mode)
   - Damage standard
   - Defense standard
   - Super Bar Max Level 3
   - Guard Gauge standard
   - Can use Air Blocking
   - Level 1 Super Combos must be done with ^E / ^H and needs 1LV of Super Bar
   - Level 2 Super Combos must be done with ^F / ^I and needs 2LVs of Super Bar
   - Level 3 Super Combos must be done with ^G / ^J and needs 3LVs of Super Bar
   - Alpha Counters needs 1LV of Super Bar and 1 block of Guard Gauge

_` V-ISM (Variable Mode)
   - Damage decreased by 15%
   - Super Bar Max Level 2
   - Guard Gauge is 10% smaller
   - Can use Air Blocking
   - Custom Combos needs 50% of Super Bar
   - Alpha Counters needs 50% of Super Bar and 1 block of Guard Gauge

- MODES OF PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` CLASSIC
   - After insert coins _O^G_+^J and press _S
   - Damage increased by 15%
   - Defense decreased by 15%
   - No Guard Gauge
   - Can't use Air Blocking, Ground Recovery, Air Recovery
   - No "missed throw" animation
   - Can't use Alpha Counters
   - Can't use Super Combos / Custom Combos
   - Use the same moves of X-ISM
   - Needs a Green Title Screen

_` MAZI
   - After insert coins _O^F_+^I and press _S
   - Damage increased by 50%
   - Defense decreased by 100%
   - Opponent needs to win only one round to win
   - Needs a Purple Title Screen

_` SAIKYO
   - After insert coins _O^E_+^H and press _S
   - Damage decreased by 15%
   - Guard Gauge is 50% smaller
   - Can't cancel a normal attack in Special Move / Super Combo
   - Dizziness defense is 50% smaller
   - Needs a Purple Title Screen

