   - Put the cursor on Random Select Box ^4 / ^6 and press _P / _K
   - Needs a Red Title Screen

_` Juni
   - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Karin for 5 seconds
   - Put the cursor on Random Select Box ^8 / ^2 and press _P / _K
   - Needs a Red Title Screen

