- SECRET CHARACTERS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` B. Ryu
   - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Ryu and press _S, then press ^E_+^I_+^G / ^H_+^F_+^J

_` Time Release Characters
   - B. Hokuto is unlocked after 2 weeks
     - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Akuma and press _S_S_S
     - Put the cursor on Kairi and press _S_S
     - Put the cursor on Hokuto and press ^F / ^I
   - Cycloid-β is unlocked after 200 hours
     - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Pullum and press _S_S_S_S
     - Put the cursor on Ryu and press _S_S_S
     - Put the cursor on Blair and press ^F / ^I
   - Cycloid-γ is unlocked after 4 weeks
     - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Garuda and press _S_S_S_S_S
     - Put the cursor on Guile and press _S_S_S_S
     - Put the cursor on Blair and press ^F / ^I

_` Unlocks all Characters with Operator's Code
   - On the Test Menu, go to DOT CROSS HATCH and press ^E^F^I^H^G^F^G^F^G^G^E^F^E^I^I^E^J

