- SECRET CHARACTERS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Kairi and Shadow Geist
   - Each characters must have a score of 500.000 points
   - Will unlock after 1 hour

_` Nanase and Garuda
   - The cumulative total of all scores must be 28.000.000 points
   - Will unlock after 1 hour

_` Kairi and Shadow Geist with Operator's Code
