- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^E : Weak Punch (_P)
^F : Medium Punch (_P)
^G : Strong Punch (_P)
^H : Weak Kick (_K)
^I : Medium Kick (_K)
^J : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws / Tech Hits
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Supers
_& Comeback Moves
_# Interrupt Moves

_` Supers
   - Needs a FULL Super Bar

_` Comeback Moves
   - Needs the Life Bar in DANGER ZONE

- GUILE -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
