   - On next round, when the platform drop, press _S

_` Classic Soundtrack Select
   - On the vs. Screen, press:
     - Akuma                                        ^G^G^H
     - Balrog                                       ^F^F^J
     - Bison                                        ^G^G^F
     - Blanka                                       ^G^G^E
     - Cammy                                        ^F^F^H
     - Chun-Li                                      ^F^F^G
