     - Full Random                                  _4_+_S_+^T
     - Programmer Levels                            _2_+_S_+^E_+^H
     - Clear All Modes                              _2_+_S_+^J

_` Mode Select
   - On the Character Select Screen, press:
     - Hide Meters                                  _S_+^E
     - Invisible Tag                                _S_+^F on both sides
