     - No Specials                                  _S_+^H
     - No Standards                                 _S_+^I
     - Tag Team                                     _S_+^J
     - Double Damage                                _6_+_S_+^E
     - Speed Select                                 _6_+_S_+^F
     - No Blocking                                  _6_+_S_+^G
     - Combo Mode                                   _6_+_S_+^H
     - No Kicks                                     _6_+_S_+^I
     - No Punches                                   _6_+_S_+^J
     - Reverse Controls                             _4_+_S_+^E
     - Swap Fighters                                _4_+_S_+^G on both sides
     - Strobe                                       _2_+_S_+^F on both sides
     - Invisible                                    _2_+_S_+^G
     - Classic Throws                               _2_+_S_+^I
   - Only on a 2P Game

_` Bonus Clips
   - On the Komande Centre Stage, press:
     - Guile strikes a pose                         _S
     - Ryu with nunchakus                           ^E^E^I^J
     - Cammy kicking baddies                        ^E^F^I^J
     - Ken punches Sagat                            ^E^H^I^F
     - Chun Li breaks her handcuffs                 ^H^E^I^G
     - Bison using electric attacks                 ^H^H^F^J
