$info=s1945iii
$cmd
Strikers 1945 III                                           © 1999 Psikyo
Strikers 1999
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@F-button : Fire
_B : Bomb
_S : Start

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Charged Fire                                                             _O@F-button

- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Maintenance Codes
   - On the Test Mode, go to MAINTENANCE CODE and enter with a code below:
     8-1-6-5-0 = Unlocks a lot of options on Test Mode
     0-1-9-9-9 = Unlocks X-36 with code
     8-1-6-3-0 = Unlocks X-36 on Random
     8-1-6-2-0 = Disables X-36
     8-1-6-1-0 = All Data Erased
     1-2-3-4-5 = Reset Scores

_` X-36
   - On the Fighter Select Screen, put the cursor on Random and press _8
   - Needs unlock on Maintenance Code first
$end

