$info=suikoenb
$cmd
Suiko Enbu                                               © 1995 Data East
Outlaws of the Lost Dynasty
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^E : Weak Punch (_P)
^F : Medium Punch (_P)
^G : Strong Punch (_P)
^H : Weak Kick (_K)
^I : Medium Kick (_K)
^J : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves

_` Weapon System
   - Moves with (W) needs the weapon to be used
   - Moves with (N) can only be done without the weapon

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) (─) Dash                                                              _6_6
_) (─) Retreat                                                           _4_4
_) (─) Run Forward                                                       _6^6
