$info=tektagt,tektagtc1a,tektagtja3,tektagtjb,tektagtjc1,tektagtub,tektagtuc1
$cmd
Tekken Tag Tournament                                        © 1999 Namco
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_a : Left Punch
_b : Right Punch
_c : Left Kick
_d : Right Kick
_e : Tag
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Throws & Multipart Throws
_) Command Moves

_` "~" between 2 buttons
   - Press the 2nd button immediately after the 1st button

_` String Moves
   - h   = High Level Attack
   - m   = Mid Level Attack
   - l   = Low Level Attack
   - M   = Mid Level Attack/Hits Knocked Down Opponent
   - L   = Low Level Attack/Hits Knocked Down Opponent
   - !   = Unblockable Move
   - {!} = Unblockable Move/Hits Knocked Down Opponent
   -  -  = No Hit
   - T   = TAG Move

_` Positions
   - BK    = Back Turned
   - FU-FT = Knocked Down with Face Up and Feet Towards opponent
   - FU-FA = Knocked Down with Face Up and Feet Away opponent
   - FD-FT = Knocked Down with Face Down and Feet Towards opponent
   - FD-FA = Knocked Down with Face Down and Feet Away opponent

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Tag Throw                                                             close _b_+_e

_( Tackle                                                                run for 11 steps
_(   ^!Punches                                                           _a_b_a_b_a / _b_a_b_a_b

