$info=umk3,umk3r10,umk3r11
$cmd
Ultimate Mortal Kombat 3                                    © 1995 Midway
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^G : High Punch
^E : Low Punch
_G : Block
^J : High Kick
^H : Low Kick
@R-button : Run
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves

_` Finishing Moves
   _` Fatality
      - After winning the match
   _` Mercy
      - After winning the 3rd round of match
      - Can be done anywhere
   _` Animality
      - After done a "MERCY", win the match
   _` Friendship
      - After winning the match
      - Can be done anywhere
      - Can't use _G on a winning round
   _` Babality
      - After winning the match
      - Can be done anywhere
      - Can't use _G on a winning round
   _` Stage Fatality
      - After winning the match on Shao Kahn's Tower Stage / The Pit 3 Stage / The Subway Stage / Scorpion's Lair Stage
      - Must be done close
      - After the Scorpion's Lair Stage Fatality _O^G on both sides to hear Dan Forden say "Crispy!!"
      - After the Scorpion's Lair Stage Fatality _O@R-button on both sides to hear Shao Kahn say "Crispy!!"

