- CHEATS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Color Select
   - 1st Color, select the character with ^E
   - 2nd Color, select the character with ^F
   - 3rd Color, select the character with ^G
   - 4th Color, select the character with ^H
   - 5th Color, select the character with ^I
   - 6th Color, select the character with ^J
   - 7th Color, select the character with ^W
   - 8th Color, select the character with ^V

_` Shadow Mode
   - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Random Select and press _S_S_S_S_O_S and press _P / _K

_` Marionette Mode
   - On the Character Select Screen, put the cursor on Ramdom Select and press _S_S_S_S_S_S_O_S and press _P / _K

_` Fight a Mid-Boss after Stage 3, 4 or 5
   - Don't lose any round
   - Win 3 matches with EX Moves / Dark Forces

_` Fight Oboro Bishamon
   - Don't lose any round
   - Win 2 matches with the EX Moves below:
     - Anakaris            Pharaoh Salvation: Yajuu Mahou / Pharaoh Decoration: Bijo Mahou
     - Bishamon            Togakubi Sarashi
     - B.B. Hood           Beautiful Memory
     - Demitri             Midnight Pleasure
     - Donovan             Change Immortal
     - Felicia             Please Help Me!
     - Hsien-Ko            Chuuka Dan
     - Huitzil             Final Guardian Beta
     - Jedah               Prova=di=Servo
     - Lilith              Gloomy Puppet Show
     - Lord Raptor         Hell Dunk
     - Morringan           Darkness Illusion
     - Pyron               Cosmo Disruption: Close / Cosmo Disruption: Far
     - Q-Bee               +B
     - Victor              Gerdenheim 3
$end

