$info=vf
$cmd
Virtua Fighter                                                © 1993 Sega
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_G : Guard
_P : Punch
_K : Kick
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Throws
_) Command Moves

_` String Moves
   - h = High Level Attack
   - m = Mid Level Attack
   - l = Low Level Attack
   - g = Hits Knocked Down Opponent

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) Dash                                                                  _6_6
_) Run                                                                   _6^6
_) Retreat                                                               _4_4
_) Low Jump                                                              _8
_) High Jump                                                             ^8
_) Side Kick                                                             _3_+_K
_) Hopping Karate Chop                                                   _8_+_P
