$info=gowcaizr
$cmd
Voltage Fighter: Gowcaizer                                 © 1995 Technos
Choujin Gakuen Gowcaizer
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_A : Quick Punch (_P)
_B : Quick Kick (_K)
_C : Strong Punch (_P)
_D : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Start
^S : Select (AES only)

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Desperation Moves
_# Copyable Moves / Hyper Copyable Moves

_` Desperation Moves
   - Needs a FLASHING Life Bar

_` Copyable Moves / Hyper Copyable Moves
   - Copyable Moves can only be done after defeating this character
   - Hyper Copyable Moves can only be done after defeating himself in a mirror match

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_) Dash                                                                  _6_6
_) Retreat                                                               _4_4
_) Taunt                                                                 _A_+_B_+_C

