$info=wargods,wargodsa,wargodsb
$cmd
War Gods                                                    © 1996 Midway
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^G : High Punch
^E : Low Punch
_G : Guard
^J : High Kick
^H : Low Kick
_c : 3-D Button
_S : Start

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves

_` Finishing Moves
   _` Auto Combo
      - After winning the match
      - Must be done close
   _` Fatality
      - After winning the match

- COMMON COMMANDS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Throw                                                                 close _6_+^E

_) Run                                                                   _6_6
_) 3-D Jump                                                              _O_c_+_G, _8 / _2
_) 3-D Walk                                                              _O_c, _8 / _2
_) 3-D Slide                                                             _O_c, _8_8 / _2_2
_) Uppercut                                                              _2_+^G
_) Leg Sweep                                                             _4_+^H
_) Roundhouse                                                            _4_+^J
_) Evasive Get Up                                                        knocked down _4_+_G
_) Get Up Attack                                                         knocked down _6_+^E_+^G
_) Unblockable Pounce Attack                                             opponent knocked down _8_+^G

Finishing Moves
- Fatality: Uppercut Ring Special                                        (close) _2_+^G
- Fatality: Roundhouse Ring Special                                      (close) _O_c_4_+^J

