$cmd
X-Men vs. Street Fighter                                    © 1996 Capcom
Created by: Fabricio Coroquer

- CONTROLS -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
^E : Weak Punch (_P)
^F : Medium Punch (_P)
^G : Strong Punch (_P)
^H : Weak Kick (_K)
^I : Medium Kick (_K)
^J : Strong Kick (_K)
_S : Taunt

- HOW TO PLAY -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_( Normal Throws
_) Command Moves
_@ Special Moves
_* Hyper-X / Super Combos

_` Hyper-X / Super Combos
   - Needs 1LV of Super Bar

- COMBO INFO -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Ground Chain-Combo
   - Type of the chain-combo that can be done on the floor
_` Jump Chain-Combo
   - Type of the chain-combo that can be done on jump
_` Super Jump Chain-Combo
   - Type of the chain-combo that can be done on Super Jump

_` Chain-Combos
   - Weak Start
     ^E _! ^F             ^H _! ^F
     ^E _! ^I             ^H _! ^I
     ^E _! ^G             ^H _! ^G
     ^E _! ^J             ^H _! ^J
   - Stronger
     ^E _! ^F _! ^G               ^H _! ^F _! ^G
