_` Strikes
   - Move that launches opponent straight forward
_` Knockdowns
   - Move that knock down opponent
_` Launchers
   - Move that launches opponent to Air Combo
   - Press _8 to Super Jump
_` Air Launchers
   - Move that launches opponent to Air Combo if the opponent is already in the air
   - Press _8 to Super Jump
_` Air Combo Finishers
   - Move that finishes the Air Combo starting the "Flying Screen Animation"
_` Variable Counter
   - Move used during a Variable Counter
_` Variable Combo
   - Move used during a Variable Combo

