_` Hyper-X
   - Needs 3LVs of Super Bar

- COMBO INFO -
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_` Ground Chain-Combo
   - Type of the chain-combo that can be done on the floor
_` Jump Chain-Combo
   - Type of the chain-combo that can be done on jump
_` Super Jump Chain-Combo
   - Type of the chain-combo that can be done on Super Jump

_` Chain-Combos
   - Punch-to-Kick
     ^E _! ^H             ^F _! ^H               ^G _! ^H
     ^E _! ^I             ^F _! ^I               ^G _! ^I
     ^E _! ^J             ^F _! ^J               ^G _! ^J
   - Kick-to-Punch
     ^H _! ^E             ^I _! ^E               ^J _! ^E
     ^H _! ^F             ^I _! ^F               ^J _! ^F
     ^H _! ^G             ^I _! ^G               ^J _! ^G
