_` Fight Akuma on Stage 6
   - Don't lose any round
   - Get a "First Attack" in 6 rounds
   - Hit with a Hyper-X on 6 rounds
   - Needs to do a combo hit of:
     - Colossus           03 hits
     - Cyclops            10 hits
     - Iceman             10 hits
     - Omega Red          05 hits
     - Psylocke           05 hits
     - Sentinel           03 hits
     - Silver Samurai     10 hits
     - Spiral             10 hits
     - Storm              10 hits
     - Wolverine          05 hits
